      "message": "What do you mean by consecutively? These ids are consecutive if no references are dropped but there can be gaps after references are gone and new references created after that will re-use the old ids. This was needed in the past, and might still be needed, to avoid excessive memory use in user-space that dynamically allocated arrays where these ids were used as the array index.",
